     "text": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "bruno.jaques@macnicadhw.com.br",
      "text": "<h3>Advanced Embedded Computing Solutions by iBase for Industrial Applications</h3>\r\n<p>The MB995 is an ATX motherboard designed for industrial applications, featuring 8th Gen Intel® Xeon® E / Core™ i7/i5/i3 processors with Intel® C246/Q370 PCH. It supports up to 64GB DDR4 memory and offers integrated graphics with DVI-D, HDMI (2.0a), and DisplayPort support. Dual Intel® Gigabit LAN ensures reliable network connectivity, while the board provides extensive I/O capabilities including USB3.1, USB3.0, COM ports, and SATAIII. With advanced features like iAMT (11.6), TPM (2.0), vPro, and iSMART, the MB995 enables efficient remote management, system integrity, and energy-saving operations.</p>\r\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Sep 23 2026 18:52:47 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
     }
    },
